  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 589a77387c7c4ea488d9368fe6c3cd2f, type: 3}
  m_Name: Sub Dialogue 5
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  characterName: Axion
  dialogues:
  - You are doing amazing! Now for the final step...
  - Each factory floor has an EXPORT building, denoted by the package icon on its
    roof. This is the output area of the factory floor.
  - Each EXPORT building expects its own unique output linked to that floor. If you
    feed it the wrong item, it will break down.
  - Feed the matrix you created with the MATRIX FACTORY into the EXPORT building
    to finish the tutorial and start building your own TRANSFORMER!
